            "review_title": "Review at Tonkin Bun Cha",
            "review_text": "Funlovinfella\nUnited Kingdom1392 contributions\n0\nThe best Vietnamese food we’ve tasted!\nMar 2025 • Couples\nOur son ate here a couple of times he was told by a local guy this was of the best authentic local food restaurants in the area, he raved about it and he wasn’t wrong!\n\nApart from the fact it was the best Vietnamese food we’ve had during our trip, it was for pennies!\n\nA mixed starter, spring rolls, two mains, two soft drinks, all for £6.20. Unbelievable!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten March 8, 2025",
